---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import FinalCta from '../components/home/FinalCta.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="How Talkera Desk Compares | Transparent Market Breakdown"
  description="Compare Talkera Desk with voicemail, human answering services, self-serve AI receptionists, and field service add-ons. Public prices, verified gaps."
  canonicalUrl="https://talkeradesk.com/compare"
>
  <div class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-light-blue border border-sky-blue text-xs font-semibold text-deep-green uppercase tracking-wider font-mono mb-4">
          Market Comparison
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-ink-deep tracking-tight mb-4">
          How Talkera Desk compares,<br />and the gap it fills.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate leading-relaxed">
          Most trade owners choose between voicemail that loses jobs, expensive human answering services that misspell technical terms, or self-serve software that leaves setup to you. Here is the exact breakdown.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Comprehensive Comparison Matrix (Spec C6) -->
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-20">
        <div class="inline-block min-w-full align-middle">
          <div class="border border-sky-blue rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white shadow-tactile">
            <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-sky-blue/60 text-xs">
              <thead class="bg-paper text-ink-deep font-heading font-bold">
                <tr>
                  <th class="py-4 px-5 text-left font-bold text-slate uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">Feature / Factor</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-4 text-left text-slate font-medium">Voicemail</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-4 text-left text-slate font-medium">Human Answering</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-4 text-left text-slate font-medium">Self-Serve AI</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-4 text-left text-slate font-medium">FSM Add-On</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-4 text-left text-slate font-medium">Enterprise AI</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-5 text-left bg-deep-green text-lime-accent font-extrabold text-sm border-l border-r border-deep-green">
                    Talkera Desk
                  </th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 text-slate">
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-ink">Typical Public Price</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Free</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">From ~$300/mo for low calls</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">From ~$49 to $300/mo</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">~$29 to $99/mo where listed</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Custom quote only</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-deep-green bg-light-blue/40 border-l border-r border-sky-blue/60">
                    From $59/mo (PAYG) or $293 to $1,292/mo
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-ink">Who Sets It Up</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">You</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Call center team</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 text-red-600 font-semibold">You configure everything</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">You configure</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Vendor over weeks</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-deep-green bg-light-blue/40 border-l border-r border-sky-blue/60">
                    We build & test it in up to 3 days
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-ink">Books Into Calendar / CRM</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 text-red-600">No</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Sometimes (extra cost)</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Sometimes (via Zapier)</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Only its own app</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Yes, supported tools</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-deep-green bg-light-blue/40 border-l border-r border-sky-blue/60">
                    Yes, direct two-way calendar sync
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-ink">Texts Caller & Crew (6-Step Loop)</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 text-red-600">No</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 text-red-600">Rarely</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 text-red-600">Rarely</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Limited</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Varies</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-deep-green bg-light-blue/40 border-l border-r border-sky-blue/60">
                    Yes, booking to 5-star review
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-ink">Human Reviews Calls & Fixes Mistakes</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 text-red-600">n/a</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Occasional QA</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 text-red-600">No (you manage)</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 text-red-600">No</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Often</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-deep-green bg-light-blue/40 border-l border-r border-sky-blue/60">
                    Yes, scheduled audits by plan
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-ink">Custom Emergency & Transfer Rules</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 text-red-600">n/a</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Yes</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Basic</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Basic</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Yes</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-deep-green bg-light-blue/40 border-l border-r border-sky-blue/60">
                    Set your way with life-safety triage
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-ink">Contract Term</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">n/a</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Often monthly or 90 days</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Monthly subscription</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Tied to software plan</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 text-red-600 font-semibold">Often annual</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-deep-green bg-light-blue/40 border-l border-r border-sky-blue/60">
                    Month to month. Cancel anytime.
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-ink">You Own Number & Call Data</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Yes</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Varies</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Varies</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Varies</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Varies</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-deep-green bg-light-blue/40 border-l border-r border-sky-blue/60">
                    Fully yours. Export within 7 days.
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section: What Is Missing Elsewhere -->
      <div class="my-20">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mb-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-light-blue border border-sky-blue text-xs font-mono font-bold text-deep-green uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
            Market Frustrations
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-heading text-ink-deep">
            What is missing from legacy tools
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate mt-1">
            Contractors frequently share these recurring complaints in trade forums regarding answering tools.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-ink-deep mb-2">Nobody Owns the Result</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate leading-relaxed">
              Software vendors sell per-minute bundles or software access, but when a call drops or an address is booked incorrectly, there is no one accountable for tuning the system.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-ink-deep mb-2">Wrong Bookings & Technical Errors</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate leading-relaxed">
              Generic bots schedule appointments in the middle of travel routes or book water restoration extractions when crews only handle HVAC diagnostics.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-ink-deep mb-2">Surprise Bills & Per-Minute Hikes</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate leading-relaxed">
              Complicated overage formulas and sudden burst penalties when severe weather strikes make monthly bills unpredictable.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-ink-deep mb-2">Weak Escalation Handoffs</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate leading-relaxed">
              When a desperate homeowner needs an immediate emergency crew, automated tools often loop or deliver dead silence instead of dialing on-call staff.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-ink-deep mb-2">Annual Contract Lock-in</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate leading-relaxed">
              Enterprise platforms force trades companies into expensive 12-month commitments before proving performance on real customer calls.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-ink-deep mb-2">Data & Number Hostage</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate leading-relaxed">
              Many services hold onto the telephone numbers or refuse clean data exports when a contractor decides to take their dispatch in-house.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Trust Card: When Talkera Desk is NOT the right fit -->
      <div class="my-20 p-8 rounded-panel bg-paper border border-sky-blue max-w-4xl mx-auto shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-deep-green text-lime-accent flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            !
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-ink-deep">
              When Talkera Desk is NOT the right fit
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate">We believe in transparent qualification rather than selling you something you don't need.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate border-t border-sky-blue/60 pt-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-brand-green font-bold">&bull;</span>
            <span><strong>You only want basic voicemail transcription:</strong> If you receive few calls and just need text logs of voicemails, buy a $49 software tool.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-brand-green font-bold">&bull;</span>
            <span><strong>You demand a live human on every call:</strong> If you believe AI voice agents are not right for your brand under any circumstance, use a traditional human call center.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-brand-green font-bold">&bull;</span>
            <span><strong>You handle HIPAA health records in the US:</strong> We do not service healthcare triage or medical clinics without a custom signed business associate agreement.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <FinalCta />
</MainLayout>
